:46:36","source":"BSE"},{"id":"397003","title":"Jubilant Pharmova appoints Mr. Daniel J. O'Connor as CEO of Jubilant Therapeutics.","summary":"Jubilant Pharmova appoints Mr. Daniel J. O'Connor as CEO of Jubilant Therapeutics.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2025-12-02T08:25:46","source":"Livesquawk"}]}]